(8, 'Maroosha Ubaid', 'marooshaubaid2@gmail.com', '03451095753', 'Graphic Designer', 'Canva, capcut, learning adobe', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aghZ2Zy-r7Idne1htY078lFxjgq22Isg', 'Intermediate', 'uploads/cvs/cv_69cac5606f06f9.80308973.pdf', 'Assalam u alaikum. I&#039;m Maroosha ubaid,a graphic designer based in Swat. I&#039;ve been learning gralhic designing since 16 and have worked on several local projects including my biggest one yet which is the first eid fest in Swat &amp; now as', '2026-03-30 18:48:00', 'reviewing'),
