(2, 25, '2026-06-23', '1.AlnafiAlgo FInalized \n2. Digital Marketing Course Submission\n3. New Role addition to website\n4. DPR added to website\n5. and some mini tasks like \n-new tasks assignments to team \n- guiding team\n-entertaining new joinees to course', 'Alot of time wasted by Adobe illustrator,, installing, verify status, uninstalling, clearing adobe creative cloud and still not installed succesfullly', '1. Optimize published ads \n2. Organize Leads Data\n3. GraphicaFix domain transfer and email setup\n4. Instll Adobe products \n5. sticker designs final', '2026-06-23 14:13:19'),
(3, 25, '2026-06-24', 'Optimized Published ads\nInstalled Adobe illustrator\nEntertained New Course Joinings\nDrafted changes to GraphicaFix website \n- course enrollment form update\n-tasks page updates\n-course manager updates\nAlnafi website testing guide', '', 'finalize and push the new changes to graphicafix website\nstickers design\nrunning ads optimization', '2026-06-24 13:00:36'),
(4, 118, '2026-06-24', 'Filter out registrants and call for confirmation and make confirmation calls + Study The English Proffeciency Course daily 7 Lecture completed Attendance Register Interview Students & Interview Marking Sheet', '', 'Pending Task', '2026-06-24 13:42:41'),
