(6, 25, '2026-06-26', '1. Finished AlnafiAlgo Changes\n-cross browser compatibilty \n-minor changes to buttons and UI \n2. GraphicaFix website updates\n-updating graphicafix studnet portal to a full fledge LMS to make it ready for upcoming new course \n-updating teacher portal as well \n- updated student enrollment form to more detailed\n-80% completed.\n3. GraphicaFix ssticker design \n-- in review \n4. updating running ads', '', 'Install Essential softwares on laptops\nApply policies and restrictions on laptops', '2026-06-26 13:40:05'),
(7, 118, '2026-06-26', '\"I have finished all the assigned tasks for today.\"', '', '\"Tomorrow, I plan to get right on top of any tasks that come in and finish them on time.\"', '2026-06-26 15:46:29'),
(8, 118, '2026-06-28', '\"All of my tasks for today are completely finished. I conducted the students\' tests and also prepared the sheets on Excel, completing everything right on time.\"', '', '\"Tomorrow\'s plan is for the new tasks, and my focus will be to complete them right on time.\"', '2026-06-28 16:23:56'),
(9, 118, '2026-06-29', '\"All of my tasks for today are completely finished. I conducted the students\' tests and also prepared the sheets on Excel, completing everything right on time. Additionally, I traveled for office work and returned after completing the assignment.\"', '', 'Plan for Tomorrow\n\"Tomorrow\'s plan is for the new tasks, and my focus will be to complete them right on time.\"', '2026-06-29 16:10:55'),
