(25, 'Suleman related commitments', '1-add suleman profile to the website\r\n2-send him, Branding Libarary.graphica Libarary for Ppt presntation.\r\n3-creat a chat bot of teacher and student communication through website \\ only for there task management.\r\n4- after delivery ask him to check and review. ask him for 9 o clock meeting \r\nthats it for todat.', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-05-15', 25, 26, '2026-05-15 14:12:59', '2026-05-16 10:40:48'),
(26, '23rd May meeting AGENDA', 'Graphica Deparment Distribution \r\nDepatment Herarchy \r\nDepartment Jobs > Descriptions >Salary/ percentage > Policies > Duties \r\nNext Goals \r\nStrategies', 'High', 'Pending', '2026-05-23', 26, 26, '2026-05-22 19:37:59', '2026-05-22 19:37:59'),
(27, 'Emergency addition to the Graphica Trannier Policy', 'Policy: Class Cancellations and Scheduling Integrity\r\n\r\n01. Class Cancellation Restrictions\r\n\r\nClasses may not be canceled under any regular circumstances. Cancellations are strictly permitted only for genuine emergencies involving:\r\n\r\n*Medical Emergencies:** Must be substantiated by the submission of an official medical report.\r\n*Immediate Family Emergencies:** Limited strictly to first-blood relations.\r\n\r\n02. Continuity of Instruction\r\n\r\nClasses cannot be delayed or postponed. In the event of an approved emergency absence, the primary trainer is fully responsible for handing over all class materials—including presentation slides, lesson transcripts, and instructional notes—to an designated alternative trainer to ensure seamless continuity.\r\n\r\n03. Curriculum and Schedule Integrity\r\n\r\nTrainers are strictly prohibited from making unauthorized modifications to any of the following institutional standards:\r\n\r\n* The approved course curriculum.\r\n* The established class schedule.\r\n* Monthly testing and training schedules.\r\n* Assigned monthly task lists.\r\n* Final examination structures or content.\r\n________________________________________/-', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-05-25', 25, 26, '2026-05-22 19:58:55', '2026-06-26 05:48:56'),
(28, 'Need to manage Course Manager', '01, It should display sepertae Student list for seperta courses > different list for Different categories of Studnets > Paid > unpaid > installment > Refferal> PVTC> Free Trial enliste', 'Medium', 'Completed', '2026-05-25', 25, 26, '2026-05-22 22:54:49', '2026-06-15 10:42:25'),
(29, 'Issue In Website Profile  (((( abhi tk to yehi points  Samajh aye hein) baki one by one i will update you the Tasks', 'o1. the  only \" All Project Button is working \" \r\n02. Too much Repetition of the Same Data .\r\n03 .home Page Should be the Home page for Graphica \r\n04. the Portfolio  Page  need improvement as of the Other buttons as Branding Website  Graphic Desining, etc are not working. \r\n05. we are unable use Different Project page url links to Share any where we want \r\n06. Urgent Need to Update The Services> Each Service will display the Relatable Link/ button From Portfolio (named as  refference work)\r\n07. update the Web development list (from Suleman Portfolio) and work done By us as in this patteren > sign in > work or list Display. end', 'Medium', 'Completed', '2026-07-06', 25, 26, '2026-05-22 23:27:58', '2026-06-26 05:49:27'),
(30, 'Created Eid Post  ZIlhajj Post and Mothersday post already ignorred  which is not a good sign', 'Create the Post and send to Maam Saba on time \r\nfor ;\r\n01.Qaswa elevators ( Insta , FB, Linkedin, and watsapp) (also add features to the website of Eid sheeps camels cartoon creatures should be in funny way) to pop up the website.\r\n02.Graphica Fix ( Same as above ) (  same as Above )\r\n\r\nNOTE: BEFORE [POSTING THE CONTENT AND GRAPHICS MY APPROVAL IS IMMIDEATE PLEASE)', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-05-24', 25, 26, '2026-05-22 23:39:22', '2026-06-16 20:36:38'),
(31, 'Add the feature of to the Website Dashboard', '01. website self sending notification to the Asigned Task person to their gmails.\r\n02. Also The feature of notification of one 24 hour before notification to the Task assigned and CEO/ Manager Alert.', 'Medium', 'Completed', '2026-06-07', 25, 26, '2026-05-22 23:45:33', '2026-06-15 10:42:49'),
(32, 'Project Alnafi, live on Alnafi Algo', 'Alnafi Algo deployment over website live \r\nNeed it\'s credentials', 'High', 'In Review', '2026-06-02', 31, 26, '2026-05-30 18:52:01', '2026-06-06 15:27:25'),
(33, 'Qaswa elevators video editing', 'Editing Qaswa elevators promotional video for courses and business promotion from raw final footage shared', 'Medium', 'Pending', '2026-06-07', 29, 25, '2026-06-06 13:59:20', '2026-06-22 12:52:02'),
(40, 'Change in the Name of Graphica from different Platforms like Fb etc  ,>>> From Graphic Designing agency into Graphica Fix , a graphic designing and modern digital service company', 'Graphica Fix is a modern digital service company that helps businesses grow through creative design, web development, SEO, and AI-powered automation solutions.\r\n\r\nWe don’t just design—we build smart digital systems that save time, reduce manual work, and increase business efficiency.', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-06-17', 25, 26, '2026-06-16 20:34:31', '2026-06-18 11:44:43'),
(41, 'Study the Engish Proffeciency course', 'Study complete course in 10 days \r\n7 lectures a day\r\nfind course at dashbaord > scroll down > resourses > english proffeciency(English at work by BBC )', 'High', 'In Progress', '2026-07-02', 118, 25, '2026-06-22 07:45:17', '2026-06-22 08:54:19'),
(43, 'Publish Digital Marketing course campagin', '', 'High', 'In Progress', '2026-06-23', 25, 25, '2026-06-23 04:28:37', '2026-06-23 12:54:46'),
(44, 'Create attendance document for interview students', 'Create attendacne docuemnt for interview students, student data sent to email', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-06-23', 118, 25, '2026-06-23 04:30:17', '2026-06-26 04:34:49'),
(45, 'Filter out registrants and call for confirmation and make confirmation calls', 'Filter out the sent file\r\nRemove Duplications \r\nMake calls for enrollment confirmation\r\nSubmit final file today for printing', 'High', 'Completed', '2026-06-23', 118, 25, '2026-06-23 05:32:36', '2026-06-26 04:34:55'),
(46, 'entry test for Applied AI course', 'Submit entry test for Applied AI course based on course content and TOC provided', 'High', 'Pending', '2026-06-23', 29, 25, '2026-06-23 12:54:32', '2026-06-23 12:54:32'),
